type: software
title: "R-Goose: a compiled, memory-deterministic engine for statistical computing (working title)"
abstract: "R-Goose keeps R's syntax and package ecosystem and compiles numerical work to native code through the Goose systems language, with deterministic, garbage-collection-free memory and results equivalent to GNU R."
